{"id":"e8a3a16d1e5a3f9b","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-omega-rule.md","title":"The Omega Rule","display":"df-omega-rule — The Omega Rule","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-omega-rule","aliases":["89-df-omega-rule"],"display":"df-omega-rule — The Omega Rule","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","[[89-df-analysis-language]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-omega-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-omega-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-rule — The Omega Rule"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ab645f955c77848\" href=\"?note=8ab645f955c77848\" title=\"89-df-analysis-language\">89-df-analysis-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为任意固定语言/理论标签。作为本定义的参数，给定有限语法公式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fml}_T\">\\(\\mathsf{Fml}_T\\)</span>、数变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_T^{\\mathsf N}\">\\(\\mathsf V_T^{\\mathsf N}\\)</span>、闭数词函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\mapsto\\bar n\">\\(n\\mapsto\\bar n\\)</span>、自由变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_T\\)</span>、数变量全称构造和避免捕获替换。</li>\n<li>在本书实际使用的实例中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T=\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 取算术语法，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathrm{An}\">\\(T=\\mathrm{An}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ab645f955c77848\" href=\"?note=8ab645f955c77848\" title=\"89-df-analysis-language\">89-df-analysis-language</a>；两者 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_T^{\\mathsf N}=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathsf V_T^{\\mathsf N}=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>。这不是把一般规则的定义域缩小到这两个标签。</li>\n<li>前提为可数集合，量化公式的全部自由变量至多为所显示的一个数变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\mathcal R_\\omega^T\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left(\\{A[x:=\\bar n]\\mid n\\in\\omega\\},\\forall x A\\right)\\ \\middle|\\\nx\\in\\mathsf V_T^{\\mathsf N},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}_T,\\ \\mathrm{FV}_T(A)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\mathcal R_\\omega^T\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left(\\{A[x:=\\bar n]\\mid n\\in\\omega\\},\\forall x A\\right)\\ \\middle|\\\nx\\in\\mathsf V_T^{\\mathsf N},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}_T,\\ \\mathrm{FV}_T(A)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 14 章，印刷页 177–180；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n前提是可数无限集合，故本规则不属于原有有限前提的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Nec}\\)</span> 或 MP 规则关系。使用完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 闭包与只使用一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 规则不同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-analysis-language","status":"resolved","id":"8ab645f955c77848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-analysis-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-analysis-language","status":"resolved","id":"8ab645f955c77848","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在本书实际使用的实例中，$T=\\mathrm{PA}$ 取算术语法，$T=\\mathrm{An}$ 取 [[89-df-analysis-language]]；两者 $\\mathsf V_T^{\\mathsf N}=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}$。这不是把一般规则的定义域缩小到这两个标签。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fml}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf V_T^{\\mathsf N}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\mapsto\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_T","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathrm{An}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf V_T^{\\mathsf N}=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\mathcal R_\\omega^T\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left(\\{A[x:=\\bar n]\\mid n\\in\\omega\\},\\forall x A\\right)\\ \\middle|\\\nx\\in\\mathsf V_T^{\\mathsf N},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}_T,\\ \\mathrm{FV}_T(A)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Nec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1583,"backlinks":[{"id":"508219e8b4c7dadf","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-rule]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-rule]] → [[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]] → [[89-thm-analysis-omega-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["a257e5b1de6880b7","8ab645f955c77848"]}